9fedbeb8fdf2.plain:
Use in your Shooting phase or the Fight phase, when you choose one of your STRIKE FORCE AQUILA, STRIKE FORCE DOMINATUS, STRIKE FORCE FUROR, STRIKE FORCE MALLEUS, STRIKE FORCE PURGATUS or STRIKE FORCE VENATOR units to shoot or fight. Until the end of the phase, an attack by one of its models that hits also wounds automatically when:
• it comes from an AQUILA model;
• it comes from a VENATOR model and targets a Fast Attack or Flyer unit (Battlefield Role);
• it comes from a MALLEUS model and targets a Heavy Support, Lord of War or Dedicated Transport unit (Battlefield Role);
• it comes from a DOMINATUS model and targets an Elites unit (Battlefield Role);
• it comes from a FUROR model and targets a Troops unit (Battlefield Role);
• it comes from a PURGATUS model and targets an HQ unit (Battlefield Role).
Each STRIKE FORCE unit can be chosen for this Stratagem only once per battle.

be62ad14800e.plain:
In your Command phase, you can pick one of your DARK ANGELS units within 6" of this WARLORD to change which doctrine its attacks use. Until your next Command phase starts, each time a model in that unit attacks:
• if your army has the Tactical Doctrine active, treat the Devastator Doctrine as active for that attack instead;
• if your army has the Assault Doctrine active, treat the Tactical Doctrine as active for that attack instead.
